{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Environmental News", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "An Environmental \"Fanatic\"", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Modals for Suggestions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you want to offer advice or give solutions to a problem, you use modals like <span class=\"italic\">might</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">could</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "These modals can go at the beginning of the sentence, or after a clause starting with \u201c<span class=\"italic\">If</span> ...\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The modal is followed by a verb in the base form. You do not use \u201c<span class=\"italic\">to</span>\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would / I'd ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I wouldn't ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You could ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You should ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Rachel Carson's father believed that his daughter should have the opportunity to explore untouched areas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Carson believed that writing about nature would set her life on an environmental path.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "What should I do to get people committed to saving our waters?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Using How to / Where to / What to + Verb", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to request information, you can use the structures: How to / Where to / What to + Verb. These structures are a polite way of asking for someone to do something.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Could you explain to people the steps on <span class=\"strong\">how to write</span> a novel?<br/>Can you tell us <span class=\"strong\">what to do</span> if you want to be an environmentalist?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These questions are often used in interviews. You ask this type of questions when you want to know more about a topic.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can</span> / <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could</span> / <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">you</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">tell (me)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">how to inspire</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">people to help the environment?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">explain </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">where to go </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">if you want to study marine biology?<span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to spread", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to extend over a large area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The population spread over Mr. Carson's empty land.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about an environmental activist.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "property", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area of land owned by someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If the growing population spread onto his property, he would be able to make his fortune.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "inspiring", "type": "name"}, {"content": "causing someone to feel creative; making them want to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Rachel Carson's life was inspiring to many environmentalists.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "factor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a circumstance that contributes to an outcome", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The main factor that helped shape Carson's life was a love of both books and nature.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "universal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "affecting all people around the world", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Carson gained universal appeal after she published her first book.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "praise", "type": "name"}, {"content": "strong approval and admiration for something or someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her first book, Under the Sea Wind, was welcomed with praise by both literary critics and scientists.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write down two (or more) problems that the following types of people might have: <ul><li>students</li> <li>workers</li> <li>the elderly</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Next, read the problems to a partner and ask for advice. Your partner should  use modals to make suggestions in their answers.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I ask help for help or advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss how to deal with problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about cause and effect and hypothetical situations.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le17ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le17ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: John, can you tell us who has inspired you as an environmentalist?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John Smits</span>: I would say Rachel Carson. Seven years before she was born, her father bought land to the south of his home near Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania. He thought that if the growing population spread onto his property, he would be able to make his fortune. He also believed that his daughter should have the opportunity to spend her childhood exploring untouched areas ."}, {"image": "engenn7le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "27000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could you explain to us why her life was so inspiring to you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John Smits</span>: The main factor that helped shape Carson's life was a love of both books and nature. Her mother believed that she could learn from her surroundings. If she looked close enough, she would understand how nature worked. Carson started to write about nature.  She believed it would set her life on an environmental path."}, {"image": "engenn7le17ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "50000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you know how Rachel Carson gained universal appeal?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John Smits</span>: After graduating, she worked as a marine biologist. She often wondered: \u201cWhat should I do to get people committed to saving our waters? If I share my passion for the sea, people will take note!\u201d This is why her first book, <span class=\"italic\">Under the Sea Wind</span>, was welcomed with praise by both literary critics and scientists."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le17ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le17ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for help or advice.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about cause and effect and hypothetical situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Who is your role model? Is it a celebrity, a sports person, a politician?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " In your opinion, which activist has made a big difference in our world? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback":